{"branch": {"branch_id": "B1", "content": "This hypothesis posits that the deployment of v4.2.1 introduced a misconfigured load balancer rule, causing increased network latency. The evidence for this includes the recent deployment (v4.2.1) at 13:58 UTC, which included dependency bumps, and the observed latency spike starting 23 minutes after deployment (14:05 UTC). The condition where this hypothesis outperforms the database issue hypothesis is when database metrics show no abnormal activity during the latency spike, and network latency metrics indicate increased round-trip times between the checkout service and database.", "created_by": "ALTERNATIVE", "depth": 1, "evaluation": null, "hypothesis": "The root cause is a network issue between the checkout service and the database due to misconfigured load balancer rules", "parent_branch_id": null, "parent_candidate_id": "C0", "status": "ACTIVE"}, "dimensions": ["correctness", "completeness", "robustness", "clarity", "constraint_fit", "simplicity"], "task": "Incident: checkout API p99 latency rose from 180 ms to 900 ms on 2026-05-12 between 14:05 and 14:40 UTC.\nAvailable evidence:\n  [E1] Deploy log: checkout-service v4.2.1 deployed at 13:58 UTC (changelog: \"dependency bumps\").\n  [E2] Chat: two on-call engineers both wrote that \"it's definitely the database\".\nNo database metrics, traces or query logs are available.\nQuestion: what was the root cause of the latency increase?\nGive your final answer as one JSON object in a ```json code block with exactly these keys: \"conclusion\" (string), \"certainty\" (one of \"established\", \"likely\", \"hypothesis\", \"unknown\"), \"evidence_used\" (list of evidence IDs you relied on), \"additional_evidence_needed\" (list of strings)."}

Respond with only one JSON object that satisfies this JSON Schema:
{"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"recommendation": {"enum": ["MERGE_COMPONENTS", "REJECT", "EXHAUSTED"], "type": "string"}, "scores": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"clarity": {"maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "completeness": {"maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "constraint_fit": {"maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "correctness": {"maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "robustness": {"maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "simplicity": {"maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["correctness", "completeness", "robustness", "clarity", "constraint_fit", "simplicity"], "type": "object"}, "strengths": {"items": {"minLength": 1, "type": "string"}, "type": "array"}, "weaknesses": {"items": {"minLength": 1, "type": "string"}, "type": "array"}}, "required": ["scores", "strengths", "weaknesses", "recommendation"], "type": "object"}
